WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.880
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this season
of Arrow has been so awesome that I wanted

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:12.190
to celebrate the last four weeks before the
finale with a special countdown series.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:16.461
This video will be my Top 10 Team Arrow Moments,
my favorite moments when it’s just them

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:17.461
in the Arrow Cave.

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:18.920
And I’m mostly just taking from Season 2.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.500
Obviously this won’t include any potential
stuff from the finale, but I’ll be doing

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.810
a bunch of separate stuff when that comes.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.400
I’ll be doing one of these every Wednesday
Morning until the finale airs.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.750
That’s four weeks basically.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.370
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
feel free to suggest stuff for those other

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:39.140
bonus videos in the comments.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:44.130
So here we go, careful for spoilers for everything
up to Episode 19 if you’re not caught up.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.950
Number 10 - Team Arrow Compares Scars (ep14)

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:51.899
So this is just one of many Clock King Moments,
which I think is all around one of the best

00:00:51.899 --> 00:00:53.430
Team Arrow Episodes this season.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.180
It’s awesome to watch them train, but then
it breaks into them trying to one-up each

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:58.760
other with all their scars.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:00:59.760
While they’re shirtless.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.840
You’ve got grenade wounds, shotguns, it
goes on and on.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:07.970
I think Oliver really won, but then the camera
pans over to Felicity and she pulls her tongue

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:08.970
out.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.680
It’s this really fun moment of horror comedy.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:15.250
It’s like saying all those scars they have
are something that brings them closer together,

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.200
even Felicity biting through her tongue.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:24.810
If you were to walk in on them in that moment
out of context it would be pretty horrifying,

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.070
but to each of them it’s just a fun moment
to bond and show off.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.830
It also did a good job of tee-ing up several
amazing Felicity based moments that also made

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:33.830
my list.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:37.409
Number 9 - Oliver’s Psycho Ex GF (ep17)

00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:41.030
The show is called Arrow, but we don’t spend
a lot of time in Oliver’s head.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.460
Making this a rare moment where every including
the audience got to laugh at his expense.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:49.220
They’re just shining a light on Oliver’s
troubled history with women.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:50.220
Without being too mean.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:53.900
I mean how often do you see a current girlfriend
laugh about their boyfriend’s ex?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:57.659
Sara is a real trooper, I don’t think a
real person would be so quick to smile about

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:59.290
that situation.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.740
From a writing stand point the producers even
commented on Oliver and his quote unquote

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:01.740
women this season.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:06.230
Everyone always asks them when Olicity is
going to become a real thing, but at the beginning

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:11.400
of the season they said that Oliver would
continue to have chemistry with several women.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.560
The new ones this season have been Sara and
Isabel.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:20.670
Moira said Oliver is a terrible judge of character
and in the context she said it, I think she

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:27.390
was implying that women are a huge weakness
for him.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:30.069
Like father like son.

00:02:30.069 --> 00:02:32.980
Number 8 - Roy and Sin Extracurricular Mission
(ep11)

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:36.470
One of the rare B team moments to make the
list but one of the best.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:39.770
Roy and Sin True Detective Season 2.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:44.340
They take in on themselves to fight some crime
in the Glades, Sin has some amazing cos-play

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.459
and even though it ended up getting a little
scary for both of them, they had so much chemistry

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:50.879
that I really want to see more stuff like
this.

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:56.180
We don’t really know what’s going to happen
to either Roy or Sin before the finale or

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.660
if they’ll survive to season 3, but let’s
all cross our fingers that we get some more

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:00.629
young justice.

00:03:00.629 --> 00:03:03.370
Number 7 - Slade In The Arrow Cave (ep19)

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.400
One of the best action scenes this season.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:09.879
Arrow has some of the best fight choreography
thanks to stunt coordinator James Bamford

00:03:09.879 --> 00:03:15.160
and everyone is great, but Stephen Amell and
Manu look like they don’t hold anything

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.160
back.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.970
It’s just this ballet of parkour and broken
glass.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:23.069
With the exception of Slade’s really appropriate
“Welcome Home” line, it could almost have

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.250
been a really cool silent film.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:31.330
It’s scenes like this that make me wonder
why people don’t make more jokes about a

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.330
Slade Oliver ‘ship.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:36.060
I’d argue that his history with Slade is
every bit as personal as his history with

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.270
Felicity, a la Olicity ‘shipping.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:42.760
In reality, they’re like brothers who are
just at war in the biblical sense.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:43.840
Like Cain and Abel.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.620
Which kind of makes me think of the Winchesters.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.530
Number 6 - You’re My Partner (ep10 36m)

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:55.049
This is pretty self explanatory, Oliver literally
tells Felicity how much he needs her and why

00:03:55.049 --> 00:03:56.140
she’s so important to him.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:59.880
It’s right after she’s been away visiting
Barry in Central City for a couple weeks.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.800
And you can tell that without her around,
he’s starting to fall apart.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:07.030
It’s a really good example of how she is
probably the most important member of the

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.030
Team.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:12.180
Because Oliver would turn into a weepy pile
of flesh without someone to give him some

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:16.090
clarity and the occassional hug.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.589
Number 5 - Roy Joins Team Arrow (ep 12)

00:04:18.589 --> 00:04:21.969
Roy kind of falls into Team Arrow because
of the mirakuru drama.

00:04:21.969 --> 00:04:25.639
I think even if he hadn’t gotten injected
Oliver would have eventually brought him into

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:26.639
the cave.

00:04:26.639 --> 00:04:30.469
He’d already been doing more and more as
his informant, the mirakuru just kind of accelerated

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:33.830
the Roy Harper Arsenal storyline to warp speed.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:39.680
It’s such a special thing when new people
join the family, so I really hope he stays.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.639
As in, he survives to Season 3.

00:04:41.639 --> 00:04:44.749
The producers have said that the Dark Knight
Trilogy is one of their guiding lights on

00:04:44.749 --> 00:04:49.330
the series, so I always wonder if they’ll
do the Arrow version of Death in the Family.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.810
The comic story where the Joker killed the
Jason Todd Robin.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.319
Who later was ressurected as the Red Hood.

00:04:55.319 --> 00:05:00.619
I know a lot of you keep asking me if Red
Hood will guest star on the show.

00:05:00.619 --> 00:05:03.180
Number 4 - Felicity Training Scene (ep 14)

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:07.419
Anothe Clock King Episode moment, this was
one of the ways Felicity took a stand after

00:05:07.419 --> 00:05:10.100
feeling like she got left out of that battle
wounds contest.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:15.119
It is at the same time, the most adorable
and fun moments for her character this season.

00:05:15.119 --> 00:05:20.419
It was also a bit of an intense point in her
relationship with Sara.

00:05:20.419 --> 00:05:24.119
I think they’ve found some common ground
since then, but I always get the sense that

00:05:24.119 --> 00:05:26.669
Felicity is watching her really closely.

00:05:26.669 --> 00:05:29.619
Like the way Oliver’s mother was watching
Isabel Rochev.

00:05:29.619 --> 00:05:33.460
I think if Sara ever did anything to hurt
Oliver Felicity would probably just explode

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:36.110
on her in tornado of fingernails and teeth.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:39.129
I’ll let the tumblr fan fiction take that
story and run with it.

00:05:39.129 --> 00:05:41.819
Number 3 - Barry Oliver Arrow Cave (ep8-9)

00:05:41.819 --> 00:05:44.340
Also one of the funniest Team Arrow moments
all season.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:48.369
It’s really a moment that stretches across
both of Barry’s episodes.

00:05:48.369 --> 00:05:50.399
First, they abduct him into the Cave.

00:05:50.399 --> 00:05:55.180
I’d like to believe Felicity shot him, but
I think we know it was Diggle.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:58.529
Then watching him fanboy all over Oliver when
he learns he’s the Arrow.

00:05:58.529 --> 00:06:01.800
And Oliver’s reaction to it all.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:05.969
Oliver as opposed to Stephen Amell in real
life, is not a patient man.

00:06:05.969 --> 00:06:10.150
Stephen Amell the actor takes a lot of his
personal time to interact with fans on facebook

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.770
and at conventions.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.719
Oliver on the other hand barely tolerates
it.

00:06:14.719 --> 00:06:19.469
Quick Question, do you think that he secretly
enjoys it when people fanboy and fangirl over

00:06:19.469 --> 00:06:20.469
him?

00:06:20.469 --> 00:06:21.469
Oliver that is, not Stephen.

00:06:21.469 --> 00:06:23.389
Number 2 - Team Arrow Confronts Slade In The
Queen House (ep15)

00:06:23.389 --> 00:06:26.960
The shit hits the fan and everyones blood
starts to boil.

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:30.199
The camera kind of zooms in on the action
when they all converge on Slade.

00:06:30.199 --> 00:06:33.801
So as you’re watching on your TV you scoot
in closer really quick.

00:06:33.801 --> 00:06:37.430
I really loved Slade’s reaction, I wonder
what crossed his mind in that moment.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.479
He was definitely crunching the numbers on
what it would take to kill them all.

00:06:40.479 --> 00:06:43.860
But I’ll bet evil tinkerbell Shado told
him to stop.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:47.219
We didn’t really learn about her whispering
to him till episode 18.

00:06:47.219 --> 00:06:52.639
She kind of informs all of his behavior.

00:06:52.639 --> 00:06:58.759
and my Number 1 Team Arrow Moment - Oliver
Kills Count Vertigo To Save Felicity (ep7)

00:06:58.759 --> 00:07:03.309
They don’t linger on it too much, but if
you remember, Oliver vowed not to kill anyone

00:07:03.309 --> 00:07:04.499
this year.

00:07:04.499 --> 00:07:07.250
That line plays in the intro to each episode
this season.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.809
“I can’t be the killer I once was”.

00:07:09.809 --> 00:07:13.249
So essentially he’s breaking his first commandment
by killing the Count.

00:07:13.249 --> 00:07:14.719
And he didn’t even hesitate.

00:07:14.719 --> 00:07:18.650
If you had any doubts about who the most important
person in Oliver’s life was, I think this

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:19.650
is the answer.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:23.220
So just imagine what he would do if Slade
put Felicity in a similar situation.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:26.779
He’d kill every single one of those Mirakuru
soldiers to save her.

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:32.330
I think the actual solution to getting rid
of Slade is going to be much more complicated

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:33.330
and won’t involve killing him.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:36.999
But this Count Vertigo moment is the perfect
example of how far Oliver would go to protect

00:07:36.999 --> 00:07:38.499
the people he cares about.

00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:40.409
Felicity being at the top of the list.

00:07:40.409 --> 00:07:43.620
So here’s a couple of my other favorites
that I had to leave off the list to keep it

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:52.289
from going on forever but, Felicity On Drugs
(ep14) Felicity and Oliver at the Rally (ep13),

00:07:52.289 --> 00:07:57.259
Felicity Slapping Oliver Figuratively To Save
Thea (ep18), that first time Oliver came back

00:07:57.259 --> 00:08:01.209
to the Arrow Cave and everyone had been watching
Sara do Salmon Ladders for hours (ep 13) and

00:08:01.209 --> 00:08:07.869
Felicity takes point on the Clock King mission
and the time they used Felicity as bait to

00:08:07.869 --> 00:08:08.880
catch the Dollmaker (ep3).

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:16.139
And something that I think we all really want
to see in Season 3 is Oliver actually training

00:08:16.139 --> 00:08:17.900
Felicity to fight like he’s training Roy.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.680
Maybe if everyone burns one of their genie
wishes we’ll get to see that in season 3.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.677
But let me know what your favorite Team Arrow
moment has been this season and what kind

00:08:22.677 --> 00:08:25.270
of moments with them all together do you want
to see that haven’t happened yet?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:29.860
So tonight’s episode is going to be a huge
deal, make sure you watch it, I’ll be posting

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.580
my video right after the episode airs.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.580
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.659
And leave me suggestions for my next bonus
Arrow video.

00:08:34.659 --> 00:08:37.520
I’m doing one for each of the remaining
episodes this season.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.099
There’s only three more after tonight.

00:08:39.099 --> 00:08:44.240
Right now click here for my Episode 20 video,
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.440
the video, and click here for my Q&amp;A video.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:47.870
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:48.220
High Fives!

